╭── Pipeline ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ diamond  source: embedded default                                                                                    │
│                                                                                                                      │
│ Graph                                                                                                                │
│   depth 0                                                                                                            │
│     code_writer                                                                                                      │
│   depth 1                                                                                                            │
│     lint             command  <- code_writer                                                                         │
│     static_analyzer  <- code_writer                                                                                  │
│   depth 2                                                                                                            │
│     test_runner      <- lint, static_analyzer                                                                        │
│                                                                                                                      │
│ Command nodes                                                                                                        │
│   command node lint: go vet ./...                                                                                    │
│   1 command node runs shell commands when this topology is active                                                    │
│                                                                                                                      │
│ hint: change it with /pipeline use <name>; this view is read-only                                                    │
│ hint: Ctrl+G shows each node's model, budget, and last result                                                        │
